fore the admissible parameters and projective setting. It produces the global and extraction witnesses with error `deltaExtract C (deltaQld ...)`, without the extra nested construction error.\n- Reuse the existing robustness absorption results. Preserve the existing constructor and source-domain qualifications; record the new rate in the blueprint and gap note. Isometry transfer and final soundness remain separate obligations.\n\n### Testing\n- Published head `ec639b674d95337fea1cc622b388b2c55e098301`: all nine local CI statuses passed in 428 seconds. Build, blueprint render, paper-gap, synchronization and proof-integrity gates ran; statement-origin was skipped by the path filter.\n- The CI workflow suite passed 727 tests with 9 skipped. Declaration-index regeneration and synchronization passed, resolving the author's earlier diagnostic of 236 stale entries in the ignored generated index; the original diagnostic remains in the author receipt.\n- The rooted axiom audit passed 1,660 declarations with zero failures and three existing statement-level warnings. No proof-level leanok declaration depends on sorryAx.\n- Focused Lean, targeted SourceUnitary/QPBT builds, root import, fresh standard-only axiom closure and normal commit hooks passed in the author packet. MAIN also passed the refreshed SourceUnitary build and verified the clean refresh, unchanged proof-module blob and identical 8,600-byte normalized contribution.\n\n---\nAddresses #585\n", "created_at": "2026-09-18T04:39:58Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-18T05:00:44Z", "closed_at": null, "merged_at": null, "merge_commit_sha": "a330e157289c53172b4f6981a04e735db18e1cf3", "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "labels": [{"id": 12025010884, "node_id": "LA_kwDOUJyJf88AAAACzL8axA", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/labels/formalization", "name": "formalization", "color": "ededed", "default": false, "description": "Lean formalization of a mathematical statement", "archiv